            "heading": "Shipping Policy",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_QXfFrU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong><br/>Order Processing Time</strong></h3><p>Orders are processed within 1–3 business days. Orders are not processed on Sundays or holidays. If there is a high order volume, processing times may be extended. We will notify customers of any significant delays.</p><h3><strong>Shipping Rates</strong></h3><p>Shipping fees are calculated at checkout based on destination, courier rates, and total order size or weight.</p><h3><strong>Delivery Time</strong></h3><p>Delivery times vary depending on the courier and destination. Most orders arrive within a few business days, although remote areas may require additional time.</p><h3><strong>Packaging & Parcel Protection</strong></h3><p>All items are packed with proper protective materials such as bubble wrap and secure outer wrapping to ensure safe transit. Customers may also request **minimal or eco‑friendly packaging** during checkout or via message, and we will accommodate when possible. If your package arrives damaged, please document the outer packaging, shipping label, inner packaging, and the item itself so we can assist you.</p><h3><strong>Failed Deliveries / Returned Shipments</strong></h3><p>If a shipment is returned due to an incomplete address, refusal of delivery, or repeated failed delivery attempts, additional reshipment fees may apply.</p><h3><strong>Lost or Delayed Packages</strong></h3><p>If tracking indicates your order is lost or significantly delayed, please contact us so we can coordinate with the courier and assist you accordingly.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
