        "heading_JRgiwV": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "class": "return",
            "heading": "RETURNS & REFUNDS POLICY",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_tFe9Rr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong><br/>Eligibility for Returns</strong></h3><p>We accept returns for defective, damaged, or incorrect items reported within 7 days of receiving your order. Please provide clear photos or videos of the issue, including the inner and outer packaging, as well as the condition of the item at the time of unboxing. Items showing misuse, accidental damage, or wear and tear after delivery are not eligible for return. Returned items must include all original packaging.</p><h3><strong>Packaging Requirement for Returned Items</strong></h3><p>All returned items must be shipped back using the same level of protective packaging used during delivery, such as bubble wrap or padded wrapping. If a returned item arrives in a more damaged condition due to insufficient packaging during return transit, refunds or replacements cannot be granted.</p><h3><strong>What Qualifies as a Defect</strong></h3><p>• Physical Damage Upon Unboxing: Visible cracks, dents, broken parts, or deep scratches present at the time of opening.<br/>• Incorrect or Missing Items: Items that do not match the order or are missing.<br/>• Ink Flow Issues on Unused Pens: Pens that fail to write even after proper priming steps.<br/>• Manufacturing Defects: Issues in craftsmanship that affect functionality.<br/><br/>Not considered defects:<br/>• Minor cosmetic marks from manufacturing<br/>• Slight packaging imperfections<br/>• Ink flow issues after a pen has been used or improperly stored<br/>• Damage caused after delivery<br/>• Damage caused by inadequate return packaging</p><h3><strong>Refunds</strong></h3><p>Refunds may be approved for defective items, incorrect shipments, or stock availability issues. Refunds may be issued back to the original payment method or provided as store credit depending on the case.</p><h3><strong>Non-Refundable / Non-Returnable Items</strong></h3><p>• Used pens or stationery<br/>• Items damaged after delivery<br/>• Engraved or customized products (unless the engraving error is on our end)<br/>• Items returned without complete packaging<br/>• Items damaged due to inadequate return packaging</p><h3><strong>How to Request a Return</strong></h3><p>Please contact customer support with your order number, photos or videos of the issue, packaging documentation, and a brief description of the concern. Our team will guide you through the return or replacement process.</p>"
          }
        }
